{"articleNo":"154150","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=154150&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[8.1.-8.2.] 2016학년도 2학기 부전공 이수 신청 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2016.07.14","hit":"4011","attachments":[{"name":"부전공 이수 신청서(양식).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=154150&attachNo=5008"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\">2016학년도 2학기 부전공 이수신청 안내</span></span></span></strong></span></font></span></span></span></span></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><u></u></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana; FONT-SIZE: 24pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><u></u></span></span></strong></span></font></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><strong></strong></span></font></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><strong></strong></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">2016학년도 2</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">학</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">기</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong><span> 부전공&nbsp;이수신청</span></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">에 관한 사항을 </span></font><font style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" color=\"#000000\"><span>아래와 같이 안내하오니 </span></font><font style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" color=\"#000000\"><span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">희망하는 학생은 신청하시기 바랍니다.</span></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><p>&nbsp;</p></span><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><font color=\"#000000\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">1. </span><font style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" color=\"#000000\">신청 기간 : <font color=\"#0900ff\">2016. 8. 1.(월) ~ 8. 2.(화)</font></font></strong></font></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\">&nbsp;</p></span><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><font color=\"#000000\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">2. 신청 장소</span></strong></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><font color=\"#000000\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp; </span></strong></font><font style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" color=\"#000000\"><span>1) <span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">부전공 </span><font style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" color=\"#000000\">해당 </font></span></font><font style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" color=\"#0900ff\"><strong>\"학사행정실\"</strong></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><font style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\" color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 2) 신청원을 작성하여 소속 학부장을 </span>경유(날인)한 후 부전공 학과장에게 제출</font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><strong><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">3. 신청 서류</span></font></strong></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;<font color=\"#0900ff\"> </font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#0900ff\">1)&nbsp;부전공 이수 신청서 1부</font></span></strong></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong><font color=\"#0900ff\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">2) 성적증명서 1부</span></font></strong></span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\">&nbsp;</p></span><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><font color=\"#000000\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">4. 신청 자격</span></strong></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp; </span></strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">1) 2학년부터 이수 가능[2016학년도 2학기 기준]</span></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 2) 이수신청 직전학기까지의 평점평균이 3.00 이상</span></font></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\">&nbsp;</p></span><font style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" color=\"#000000\"><span><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><font color=\"#000000\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">5. 신청학부 및 허용인원</span></strong></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp; 1) 신청학부 : 붙임 [별표] 참조</span></font></p></span></font><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><font style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" color=\"#000000\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;2) 허용인원 : 전공별 배정정원의 50%이내에서 선발</span></font></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\">&nbsp;</p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><p>&nbsp;</p></span><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">붙임&nbsp; </span></font><font style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" color=\"#000000\"><span>부전공 이수&nbsp;신청서 양식 1부</span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">2016. 7.</span></font></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><strong></strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\">교 무 처 장</span></span></strong></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\">&nbsp;</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
